00:00:27.295 --> 00:00:33.040
-Who is going to win the Ballon d’Or?
-WHAT? Why has no one invited me?!&nbsp;

00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:35.760
-It’s so clear it’s so easy to see
LET’S GO!&nbsp;

00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:40.560
The best player in the world this year was me
73 goals! 8 assists!&nbsp;

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:43.329
