00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:19.351
-Who is going to win the Ballon d’Or?
-It has to be me! Harry Kane!&nbsp;

00:01:19.351 --> 00:01:22.817
MBE!
-Who is going to win the Ballon d’Or?&nbsp;

00:01:22.817 --> 00:01:25.383
-It has to be me!
