00:01:25.383 --> 00:01:30.616
-Who is going to win the Ballon d’Or?
-It better be me or they’ll riot in Paris!&nbsp;

00:01:30.616 --> 00:01:36.080
-Who is going to win the Ballon d’Or?
-What?! Why did nobody voted for me?!&nbsp;

00:01:36.080 --> 00:01:41.200
